                            <comment id="502334" author="cbordage" created="Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:41:46 +0000">&lt;p&gt;The fix for this ticket should also solve &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19651" title="conf-sanity test_5h: LNetError: lnet_acceptor_remove_socket() Interface eth0 not found" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19651"&gt;LU-19651&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="506175" author="cbordage" created="Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:14:44 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Duplicate of &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19651" title="conf-sanity test_5h: LNetError: lnet_acceptor_remove_socket() Interface eth0 not found" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19651"&gt;LU-19651&lt;/a&gt;. The __wake_up_common() crash in tcp_child_process() described here was fixed by &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20132" title="sanity-lnet test cleanup: NULL deref in __wake_up_common via tcp_child_process on lnet reload" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20132"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20132&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. The shutdown ordering and listener callback teardown fixes continue in &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/69292" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/69292&lt;/a&gt; under &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19651" title="conf-sanity test_5h: LNetError: lnet_acceptor_remove_socket() Interface eth0 not found" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19651"&gt;LU-19651&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
